DTEND:20261202T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Gregg Museum opens its doors exclusively for NC State stude
 nts to study in a quiet environment. Bring your books and computers and st
 udy in the museum’s main lobby. Take a break and explore the galleries o
 r bring a snack to enjoy in the museum’s pollinator garden.
GEO:35.784762;-78.661636
LOCATION:Gregg Museum of Art & Design
